{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301055","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301055","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430105501:1":{"text":"빵뿐만 아니라 당연히 맥주도 준비했지!","source_cn":"除了面包，我当然为他们准备了啤酒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x953757A23388CA3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430105502:1":{"text":"그런데 이상한 점은 말이야, 빵만 남은 게 아니야. 맥주도 남았어!","source_cn":"可不正常的是，他们不仅剩下了面包，连啤酒都有剩余！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x619FF0C636BF8A00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430105503:1":{"text":"이건 말도 안 돼! 광산 쪽에 무슨 일이 있는지 알아봐야겠어!","source_cn":"这太不正常了！我得去打听一下矿洞的情况！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AB2F44CC5978B3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人巴尔姆":{"text":"드워프 바룸","source":"矮人巴尔姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}